  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 316.03 Background Investigation Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 316.03 Background Investigation Requirements.\n\n(a) At the same time that an applicant identified in Env-Sw 316.02 submits an application to the department, the applicant shall submit to the NHDOJ:\n\n(1) The personal and business disclosure forms and additional information required by Env-Sw 316.04 for all individuals and entities, respectively, identified in Env-Sw 316.05;\n\n(2) The New Hampshire department of safety “Criminal History Record Information Release Authorization Form”, DSSP256, September 2022, required by RSA 149-M:9, III(b)(1) and RSA 149-M:9, XIII(a), available at https://www.nhsp.dos.nh.gov/sites/g/files/ehbemt461/files/inline-documents/sonh/dssp2561_vgmedits.pdf; and\n\n(3) A complete set of fingerprints taken by a qualified law enforcement agency and payment required by division of state police regulations, as required by RSA 149-M:9, III(b)(1) and RSA 149-M:9, XII(a).\n\n(b) Applicants shall cooperate fully with the NHDOJ and the New Hampshire department of safety during the background investigation.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300) #8462-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #10595, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14124, eff 11-23-24, EXPIRES: 11-23-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw300.html"
